+| RTG-... | Sales | per ad set | Rp ... | 2 | Web 30 hari, Engager 60 hari | testimoni, penawaran |
+
+### Naming convention
+Campaign: ... | Ad set: ... | Ad: ...
+
+### Jadwal evaluasi
+Hari ke-3: ... | Hari ke-7: ... | Aturan scaling: ...
