+| TEST-SerumA-ID-2026-11 | per ad set | Rp 150.000 | 2 | Broad 22-45 (3 video + 2 gambar per ad set) |
+| PROS-SerumA-ID-2026-11 | CBO | Rp 275.000 | 3 | Broad 22-45; LAL 1% pembeli; Interest "perawatan kulit" |
